<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Take it: Take a bus, Leave it: Take a car)</font>

597
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:03,910
<font size="64">- Oh, no... - Okay!</font>

598
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:06,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Take It, Team Leave It)</font>

599
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:05,780
<font size="64">- Oh, no... - Okay!</font>

600
00:15:05,780 --> 00:15:07,310
<font size="64">- A bus... - A car is much better.</font>

601
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:09,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They will be split between a bus and a car for the mission.)</font>

602
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:08,680
<font size="64">Is a car the better choice?</font>

603
00:15:09,310 --> 00:15:11,150
<font size="64">The first team to arrive...</font>

604
00:15:11,150 --> 00:15:12,580
<font size="64">and claim the flag wins.</font>

605
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:14,520
<font size="64">- Oh, really? - That's not easy.</font>

606
00:15:14,590 --> 00:15:16,650
<font size="64">- Team Take It got ten dollars. - Yes.</font>

607
00:15:16,650 --> 00:15:19,190
<font size="64">- Charge your transportation card... - Okay.</font>

608
00:15:19,190 --> 00:15:20,390
<font size="64">and use public transport.</font>

609
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:21,430
<font size="64">We must do that ourselves?</font>

610
00:15:21,430 --> 00:15:23,190
<font size="64">- Yes. - Where can we do that?</font>

611
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:26,200
<font size="64">Team Leave It will drive to the destination.</font>

612
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:27,930
<font size="64">- I see. - That can be done.</font>

613
00:15:27,930 --> 00:15:29,370
<font size="64">- I should've chosen "leave it." - A bus...</font>

614
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:32,170
<font size="64">- I didn't want to take it. - I should've said no.</font>

615
00:15:32,170 --> 00:15:33,540
<font size="64">- But this option... - Yes.</font>

616
00:15:33,540 --> 00:15:35,010
<font size="64">I've never said no.</font>

617
00:15:35,010 --> 00:15:36,370
<font size="64">- Right. - They offered cash.</font>

618
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:37,680
<font size="64">You can give it to me.</font>

619
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,680
<font size="64">- It's my bus fare. - Team Leave It...</font>

620
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:42,810
<font size="64">Neither team can use their phones or car GPS.</font>

621
00:15:42,810 --> 00:15:44,820
<font size="64">- That's... - We'll give you a map.</font>

622
00:15:44,820 --> 00:15:46,550
<font size="64">- A map? Okay. - Use that to find your way.</font>

623
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:47,750
<font size="64">- It'll show everything. - Nice.</font>

624
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:50,620
<font size="64">The destination is 45 minutes away by bus...</font>

625
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:52,820
<font size="64">and just 15 minutes by car.</font>

626
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:55,090
<font size="64">Those taking the bus will get a more detailed map.</font>

627
00:15:55,090 --> 00:15:57,130
<font size="64">- Yes. We need that. - Okay.</font>

628
00:15:57,130 --> 00:15:58,860
<font size="64">- Sounds good. - Yes.</font>

629
00:15:58,860 --> 00:15:59,930
<font size="64">- Okay. - Let's go.</font>

630
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Both teams get maps.)</font>

631
00:15:59,930 --> 00:16:01,170
<font size="64">- Map, please. - Okay.</font>

632
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:04,270
<font size="64">I do tend to figure my way with a map.</font>

633
00:16:04,270 --> 00:16:06,140
<font size="64">They're different. We shouldn't show the others.</font>

634
00:16:04,570 --> 00:16:08,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Bus, Team Car)</font>

635
00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:07,500
<font size="64">- The bus team. - It's really detailed.</font>

636
00:16:07,500 --> 00:16:08,610
<font size="64">Don't let the others see.</font>

637
00:16:08,770 --> 00:16:11,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They split up and check the maps.)</font>

638
00:16:09,370 --> 00:16:10,510
<font size="64">Don't look. Go away.</font>

639
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:11,940
<font size="64">I'm on your team.</font>

640
00:16:11,940 --> 00:16:13,010
<font size="64">Are you?</font>

641
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:14,080
<font size="64">- I'm taking the bus. - I don't think so.</font>

642
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:17,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The bus takers' map has more detail.)</font>

643
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,710
<font size="64">- I am. I have ten dollars. - Do you?</font>

644
00:16:17,210 --> 00:16:18,320
<font size="64">- Deungchon-dong. - I know this place.</font>

645
00:16:17,310 --> 00:16:19,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current location: cafe, Destination: outdoor stage)</font>

646
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,450
<font size="64">Near the Deungchon-dong SBS building.</font>

647
00:16:19,150 --> 00:16:20,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The shortest route goes...)</font>

648
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:20,820
<font size="64">Yes, it's near SBS.</font>

649
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:23,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(through Sangam-dong and across the bridge.)</font>

650
00:16:20,820 --> 00:16:22,690
<font size="64">- This way. - Hey, from here...</font>

651
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:23,890
<font size="64">The used-car market...</font>

652
00:16:23,890 --> 00:16:26,220
<font size="64">We can take the town shuttle bus.</font>

653
00:16:24,090 --> 00:16:28,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they be able to find their way there by bus?)</font>

654
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:27,420
<font size="64">Cross the road here...</font>

655
00:16:27,420 --> 00:16:28,530
<font size="64">and one bus ride and we're there.</font>

656
00:16:28,590 --> 00:16:29,590
<font size="64">Let's have a look.</font>

657
00:16:29,430 --> 00:16:32,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Car also checks the map.)</font>

658
00:16:30,090 --> 00:16:31,100
<font size="64">Do you know this area?</font>

659
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:32,560
<font size="64">- Do you know the area? - Yes, I know the area.</font>

660
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:33,900
<font size="64">- Do you? - Yes.</font>

661
00:16:33,230 --> 00:16:35,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Compared to Team Bus's map,)</font>

662
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:35,630
<font size="64">- There's a cafe here. - Where are we going?</font>

663
00:16:35,630 --> 00:16:36,900
<font size="64">- Here? - Yes.</font>

664
00:16:35,770 --> 00:16:38,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Car's map has fewer landmarks on it.)</font>

665
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:38,300
<font size="64">I know this place. We're right here.</font>

666
00:16:38,300 --> 00:16:39,370
<font size="64">I know too.</font>

667
00:16:39,370 --> 00:16:40,640
<font size="64">- Let's go. - Let's head out.</font>

668
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:43,240
<font size="64">- We can't look it up. - Go, let's go.</font>

669
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:44,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Car sets off.)</font>

670
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:46,280
<font size="64">Hey, what a cute car.</font>

671
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:48,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The car is parked right in the building's parking lot.)</font>

672
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,050
<font size="64">- Gosh. - It's adorable.</font>

673
00:16:48,350 --> 00:16:49,850
<font size="64">Let's get going.</font>

674
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:51,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The navigation system is sealed.)</font>

675
00:16:49,850 --> 00:16:51,280
<font size="64">- Eun Bi, sit up front. - Okay.</font>

676
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:53,120
<font size="64">- Let's go. - Oh, gosh.</font>

677
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:55,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They quickly get in.)</font>

678
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,990
<font size="64">Let's go.</font>

679
00:16:55,850 --> 00:16:59,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're greatly advantaged if they navigate well.)</font>

680
00:16:57,020 --> 00:16:59,590
<font size="64">This car. It's pretty cute.</font>

681
00:16:59,590 --> 00:17:00,690
<font size="64">Do you have any money?</font>

682
00:17:01,130 --> 00:17:02,660
<font size="64">- Why? - Are you stealing from us?</font>

683
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:05,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eun Bi steals money as soon as they get in.)</font>

684
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:03,830
<font size="64">What are you up to?</font>

685
00:17:03,830 --> 00:17:04,860
<font size="64">You're bullying us already?</font>

686
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:05,900
<font size="64">You need money?</font>

687
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:08,230
<font size="64">Can you buy me something at the drive-through here?</font>

688
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:09,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(McDonald's drive-through)</font>

689
00:17:08,230 --> 00:17:09,270
<font size="64">We have no time.</font>

690
00:17:09,930 --> 00:17:12,070
<font size="64">The destination is 45 minutes away by bus,</font>

691
00:17:10,270 --> 00:17:12,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She heard her Team Car...)</font>

692
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:14,610
<font size="64">- and just 15 minutes by car. - Yes.</font>

693
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:14,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(could arrive 30 minutes before Team Bus.)</font>

694
00:17:14,610 --> 00:17:17,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Planning already)</font>

695
00:17:14,610 --> 00:17:16,710
<font size="64">- Yes. - We need that.</font>

696
00:17:16,710 --> 00:17:17,980
<font size="64">Okay!</font>

697
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:20,240
<font size="64">Can you buy me something at the drive-through here?</font>

698
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,350
<font size="64">We have no time.</font>

699
00:17:21,650 --> 00:17:22,710
<font size="64">What do you want?</font>

700
00:17:22,710 --> 00:17:24,280
<font size="64">Can you buy me an ice cream?</font>

701
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:26,180
<font size="64">- You want ice cream? - Yes.</font>

702
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:27,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pleading with sparkling eyes)</font>

703
00:17:26,180 --> 00:17:27,450
<font size="64">- In the morning? - Yes.</font>

704
00:17:27,450 --> 00:17:29,750
<font size="64">She had silken tofu for breakfast.</font>

705
00:17:29,750 --> 00:17:31,050
<font size="64">- I had silken tofu stew. - What time...</font>

706
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:32,520
<font size="64">- When did you have that? - Good for you.</font>

707
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:34,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She gets a huge appetite ahead of her comeback.)</font>

708
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:34,160
<font size="64">On the way here, in the car.</font>

709
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,190
<font size="64">Well done.</font>

710
00:17:35,190 --> 00:17:37,090
<font size="64">Shall we go to the drive-through and get an ice cream each?</font>

711
00:17:37,090 --> 00:17:38,730
<font size="64">- Yes. - For real? Thank you.</font>

712
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:40,400
<font size="64">- I'm so touched. - Okay.</font>

713
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:41,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Trusting the extra 30 minutes, they head to McDonald's.)</font>

714
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,970
<font size="64">Let's see. If we take a bus...</font>

715
00:17:41,270 --> 00:17:44,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Bus heads to the bus stop.)</font>

716
00:17:41,970 --> 00:17:43,600
<font size="64">Take a bus</font>

717
00:17:43,930 --> 00:17:44,970
<font size="64">Are you all right?</font>

718
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:45,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Worried)</font>

719
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:47,700
<font size="64">How was it? What did you think about my opening?</font>

720
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,470
<font size="64">Do you want a score or what?</font>

721
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:50,770
<font size="64">Give me a score.</font>

722
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:53,080
<font size="64">It wasn't even worth one point.</font>

723
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:55,980
<font size="64">- You can go slow. - I get better later on.</font>

724
00:17:54,380 --> 00:17:57,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The opening was miserable.)</font>

725
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:57,980
<font size="64">- Take your time. - Okay.</font>

726
00:17:58,080 --> 00:17:59,820
<font size="64">- Running Man has lots of fans. - Yes.</font>

727
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,620
<font size="64">- You must act natural. - Take your time.</font>

728
00:18:00,950 --> 00:18:03,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's at it again.)</font>

729
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:03,120
<font size="64">- Right, you can't. - You can't be too eager.</font>

730
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:04,250
<font size="64">- Variety shows... - Right.</font>

731
00:18:04,490 --> 00:18:07,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The real Won Hun is still at it.)</font>

732
00:18:04,490 --> 00:18:05,820
<font size="64">You shouldn't try too hard.</font>

733
00:18:05,820 --> 00:18:07,490
<font size="64">- Talk when you're beside Seok Jin. - Okay.</font>

734
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:09,430
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - What?</font>

735
00:18:09,630 --> 00:18:11,530
<font size="64">How about we take a shuttle bus nearby?</font>

736
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:13,900
<font size="64">- It's just a suggestion. - Sure, let's head over first.</font>

737
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,470
<font size="64">- Let's check that. - We need a transportation card.</font>

738
00:18:15,570 --> 00:18:17,330
<font size="64">We must go to Gangseo Community Sports Center.</font>

739
00:18:17,330 --> 00:18:18,440
<font size="64">- Yes. - What's this?</font>

740
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,500
<font size="64">Charge and use this.</font>

741
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:21,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They get chargeable transportation cards.)</font>

742
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:22,240
<font size="64">- It's the transportation card. - Five people...</font>

743
00:18:21,770 --> 00:18:23,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The money they have)</font>

744
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:24,070
<font size="64">- Fifty dollars. - Won't ten dollars cover us all?</font>

745
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:25,540
<font size="64">You can pay with one card.</font>

746
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:26,540
<font size="64">A convenience store.</font>

747
00:18:28,350 --> 00:18:30,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suddenly relaxed)</font>

748
00:18:28,410 --> 00:18:29,950
<font size="64">What a nice neighborhood.</font>

749
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:31,280
<font size="64">There's a school zone.</font>

750
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:33,480
<font size="64">- It's nice. - We don't have time to spare.</font>

751
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:36,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It will take them 45 minutes even if they don't get lost.)</font>

752
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,890
<font size="64">- We don't? - We need to win.</font>

753
00:18:35,890 --> 00:18:37,390
<font size="64">We can't run, though.</font>

754
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:39,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Glaring)</font>

755
00:18:37,990 --> 00:18:39,020
<font size="64">From the start.</font>

756
00:18:39,020 --> 00:18:40,660
<font size="64">We must move fast and win.</font>

757
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:41,890
<font size="64">Will the others take a taxi?</font>

758
00:18:42,090 --> 00:18:43,460
<font size="64">They'll drive.</font>

759
00:18:42,390 --> 00:18:43,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What are you talking about?)</font>

760
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:45,200
<font size="64">- They got a car? - Yes.</font>

761
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:46,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He understands the rules late again.)</font>

762
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:47,300
<font size="64">Then we'll lose. Let's hurry.</font>

763
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:48,370
<font size="64">We need to hurry.</font>

764
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:50,100
<font size="64">- Do you have cash? - Say something.</font>

765
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,270
<font size="64">Already?</font>

766
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,300
<font size="64">- Of course. - Okay.</font>

767
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:53,600
<font size="64">What a nice neighborhood.</font>

768
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:55,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Being awkward)</font>

769
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:55,210
<font size="64">There's a school zone.</font>

770
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,370
<font size="64">We don't have time to spare.</font>

771
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:58,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He made a pointless comment.)</font>

772
00:18:57,370 --> 00:18:58,880
<font size="64">- We don't? - We need to win.</font>

773
00:18:58,910 --> 00:19:00,940
<font size="64">- Nitpick whenever Seok Jin talks. - Okay.</font>

774
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:01,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Do that instead.)</font>

775
00:19:01,150 --> 00:19:02,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Gulping)</font>

776
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,580
<font size="64">Whatever he says. That's your mission today.</font>

777
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:05,420
<font size="64">- If Seok Jin hits you, - Got it.</font>

778
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:06,650
<font size="64">it's a good day.</font>

779
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,120
<font size="64">- Shall I start now? - Keep on...</font>

780
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:10,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Senior Yang secretly gives him a personal mission.)</font>

781
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,250
<font size="64">Pick on Seok Jin.</font>

782
00:19:09,250 --> 00:19:10,990
<font size="64">Say things like you think he's wrong.</font>

783
00:19:11,050 --> 00:19:13,090
<font size="64">- I know the real you, Won Hun. - Yes.</font>

784
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:18,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Real Won Hun)</font>

785
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:18,030
<font size="64">You're polite and honest.</font>

786
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:22,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fake Won Hun)</font>

787
00:19:18,630 --> 00:19:19,760
<font size="64">Seok Jin dislikes that.</font>

788
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,800
<font size="64">- You can pick on him. - I should be naughty.</font>

789
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:25,640
<font size="64">Seok Jin, don't you ride the bus for free?</font>

790
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:28,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mission start)</font>

791
00:19:26,370 --> 00:19:28,070
<font size="64">Don't you ride the bus for free?</font>

792
00:19:30,370 --> 00:19:32,080
<font size="64">- In a few years. - Come here, you.</font>

793
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:33,710
<font size="64">I will teach you...</font>

794
00:19:33,710 --> 00:19:35,780
<font size="64">You should teach him from the start. I have five more years.</font>

795
00:19:36,010 --> 00:19:37,410
<font size="64">- I had no idea. - How dare you?</font>

796
00:19:37,450 --> 00:19:38,820
<font size="64">- Hey. - He didn't know.</font>

797
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:40,080
<font size="64">Let's hurry. He didn't know.</font>

