999
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,620
<font size="64">The Blue Dragon Best Male Entertainer award.</font>

1000
00:24:11,620 --> 00:24:13,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Local)</font>

1001
00:24:11,620 --> 00:24:12,760
<font size="64">I get that. Good for you.</font>

1002
00:24:12,760 --> 00:24:14,020
<font size="64">Kim Won Ho.</font>

1003
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:15,460
<font size="64">- Poor you. - Thank you.</font>

1004
00:24:14,490 --> 00:24:17,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Offers praise, not knowing his full name)</font>

1005
00:24:15,630 --> 00:24:16,630
<font size="64">Good for you.</font>

1006
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:20,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Looks oddly pleased)</font>

1007
00:24:18,430 --> 00:24:20,500
<font size="64">- Won Hun. - Hello.</font>

1008
00:24:21,460 --> 00:24:23,100
<font size="64">Jee Seok Jin looks really young.</font>

1009
00:24:21,600 --> 00:24:24,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Local)</font>

1010
00:24:23,170 --> 00:24:24,900
<font size="64">- Seok Jin? She says you look young. - What?</font>

1011
00:24:24,900 --> 00:24:26,470
<font size="64">I'm not that old.</font>

1012
00:24:26,470 --> 00:24:27,970
<font size="64">He got stem cell injections.</font>

1013
00:24:26,840 --> 00:24:29,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suddenly)</font>

1014
00:24:27,970 --> 00:24:29,710
<font size="64">- Yes... - You got younger.</font>

1015
00:24:29,010 --> 00:24:31,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Local)</font>

1016
00:24:29,710 --> 00:24:30,740
<font size="64">Thank you.</font>

1017
00:24:31,110 --> 00:24:33,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Taking the opportunity to spread fake news)</font>

1018
00:24:31,210 --> 00:24:33,340
<font size="64">- "You got younger." - Actually...</font>

1019
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:36,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's not true, but the anti-aging treatment went well.)</font>

1020
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,010
<font size="64">Can you spread the word for me?</font>

1021
00:24:35,010 --> 00:24:36,810
<font size="64">- Don't I look young? - Totally.</font>

1022
00:24:36,810 --> 00:24:38,820
<font size="64">- He's 61. - Shut it.</font>

1023
00:24:38,820 --> 00:24:39,880
<font size="64">He's really 61.</font>

1024
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:41,790
<font size="64">I'm not that old. I'm really not.</font>

1025
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:43,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam 61 proves to the world that he looks young for his age.)</font>

1026
00:24:43,520 --> 00:24:46,560
<font size="64">I see. We're taking a left here. We're almost there.</font>

1027
00:24:46,460 --> 00:24:47,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Jae Seok)</font>

1028
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:48,930
<font size="64">- Jae Seok, we have to get off. - This is our stop.</font>

1029
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:51,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They arrive at the transfer stop.)</font>

1030
00:24:48,930 --> 00:24:49,960
<font size="64">- Right here? - Yes.</font>

1031
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:51,930
<font size="64">- Take care. - Let's go. Thank you.</font>

1032
00:24:52,060 --> 00:24:55,030
<font size="64">- Watch your joints as you get off. - Tap your card before getting off.</font>

1033
00:24:52,800 --> 00:24:55,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Joking around)</font>

1034
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:56,230
<font size="64">Don't forget to tap your card.</font>

1035
00:24:56,230 --> 00:24:57,230
<font size="64">Is this where we take the next bus?</font>

1036
00:24:56,430 --> 00:24:58,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Scanning the bus routes)</font>

1037
00:24:57,230 --> 00:24:58,800
<font size="64">- Okay, let's take a look. - Here.</font>

1038
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,600
<font size="64">Jae Seok. Hold on.</font>

1039
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:03,210
<font size="64">We have to go that way.</font>

1040
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:05,240
<font size="64">Straight down and to the right across the Gayang Bridge.</font>

1041
00:25:05,110 --> 00:25:06,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current location)</font>

1042
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,610
<font size="64">We need to make a right there.</font>

1043
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:09,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Following Navigation Yang, they cross the street to transfer.)</font>

1044
00:25:06,610 --> 00:25:07,840
<font size="64">- That way? - Yes.</font>

1045
00:25:08,010 --> 00:25:09,010
<font size="64">Here.</font>

1046
00:25:09,710 --> 00:25:12,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(All they have to do now is find the bus that goes across Gayang Bridge.)</font>

1047
00:25:09,850 --> 00:25:10,880
<font size="64">Which bus do we need to take?</font>

1048
00:25:11,350 --> 00:25:13,520
<font size="64">- Wait, check this one out. - From here...</font>

1049
00:25:13,780 --> 00:25:14,820
<font size="64">Gayang.</font>

1050
00:25:14,950 --> 00:25:17,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He found a bus that goes straight there.)</font>

1051
00:25:14,990 --> 00:25:16,350
<font size="64">- Gayang. - Gayang Station.</font>

1052
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:18,150
<font size="64">- Does it go to Gayang? - Yes, Gayang.</font>

1053
00:25:17,750 --> 00:25:21,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They'll cross Gayang Bridge to go to Gayang Station.)</font>

1054
00:25:18,150 --> 00:25:19,360
<font size="64">Which bus is it?</font>

1055
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:20,720
<font size="64">It's 7602.</font>

1056
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,730
<font size="64">- It's a red bus. - Their intervals are long.</font>

1057
00:25:22,730 --> 00:25:23,730
<font size="64">I know.</font>

1058
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:27,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They found the right bus stop, but the buses don't come often.)</font>

1059
00:25:24,530 --> 00:25:25,630
<font size="64">This is bad.</font>

1060
00:25:25,630 --> 00:25:26,700
<font size="64">They're going to get there...</font>

1061
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:27,730
<font size="64">- so fast. - Really?</font>

1062
00:25:27,730 --> 00:25:29,130
<font size="64">They know they just need...</font>

1063
00:25:27,830 --> 00:25:32,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Car)</font>

1064
00:25:29,130 --> 00:25:30,500
<font size="64">- to cross Gayang Bridge. - Exactly.</font>

1065
00:25:30,700 --> 00:25:31,970
<font size="64">I bet they've already crossed it.</font>

1066
00:25:31,970 --> 00:25:33,800
<font size="64">Is it here already? There's our bus.</font>

1067
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:35,010
<font size="64">- It's here. - I think that's it.</font>

1068
00:25:35,010 --> 00:25:36,570
<font size="64">- Wait. Get ready, guys. - Is that it?</font>

1069
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:37,710
<font size="64">- Because it's a red bus. - Express buses cost more.</font>

1070
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:40,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Luckily, the bus arrives right on time!)</font>

1071
00:25:37,710 --> 00:25:39,510
<font size="64">- Is the fare higher? - Yes.</font>

1072
00:25:39,510 --> 00:25:40,740
<font size="64">And we all need to sit...</font>

1073
00:25:40,110 --> 00:25:43,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Bus catch another bus without a long wait.)</font>

1074
00:25:40,740 --> 00:25:41,850
<font size="64">- in the seats. - Gayang Station.</font>

1075
00:25:41,850 --> 00:25:43,450
<font size="64">There are 36 empty seats.</font>

1076
00:25:43,450 --> 00:25:44,650
<font size="64">- The number shows up here. - The fare is higher.</font>

1077
00:25:44,650 --> 00:25:46,150
<font size="64">Wait, it's 3.2 dollars. It's expensive.</font>

1078
00:25:46,150 --> 00:25:47,180
<font size="64">- Shall we? - Go ahead.</font>

1079
00:25:47,250 --> 00:25:48,750
<font size="64">- No one's a minor, right? - Five.</font>

1080
00:25:48,750 --> 00:25:50,720
<font size="64">- Who could be a minor? - Two...</font>

1081
00:25:49,220 --> 00:25:52,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What Seok Sam says is ridiculous.)</font>

1082
00:25:50,720 --> 00:25:52,520
<font size="64">- Seok Jin, get a grip on yourself. - Three.</font>

1083
00:25:52,520 --> 00:25:55,560
<font size="64">Is it free if you're 61?</font>

1084
00:25:55,890 --> 00:25:58,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Won Ho is trying to save his big brother from paying the bus fare.)</font>

1085
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:58,430
<font size="64">- For 5 people, please. - It's not free even if you're 61.</font>

1086
00:25:58,430 --> 00:25:59,430
<font size="64">What a bummer.</font>

1087
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:01,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Disappointed)</font>

1088
00:25:59,430 --> 00:26:00,530
<font size="64">Seok Jin, here's a priority seat...</font>

1089
00:26:00,530 --> 00:26:01,600
<font size="64">- for you. - Thanks.</font>

1090
00:26:02,230 --> 00:26:03,330
<font size="64">Five people, please.</font>

1091
00:26:02,470 --> 00:26:05,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They all get on the bus without anyone riding for free.)</font>

1092
00:26:05,540 --> 00:26:06,640
<font size="64">Transfer.</font>

1093
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,970
<font size="64">- Hold on. This... - My gosh.</font>

1094
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:09,670
<font size="64">We need to watch the stops.</font>

1095
00:26:09,740 --> 00:26:11,740
<font size="64">- Did you talk to the driver? - We need to cross Gayang Bridge.</font>

1096
00:26:10,010 --> 00:26:13,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Their current destination is Gayang Station.)</font>

1097
00:26:11,740 --> 00:26:13,540
<font size="64">Let's check after we cross Gayang Bridge.</font>

1098
00:26:13,540 --> 00:26:14,840
<font size="64">It'll make a right here.</font>

1099
00:26:13,810 --> 00:26:15,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just trust me.)</font>

1100
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:15,850
<font size="64">You're right. There we go.</font>

1101
00:26:15,850 --> 00:26:18,680
<font size="64">I think we can get off after we cross Gayang Bridge.</font>

1102
00:26:16,310 --> 00:26:18,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thanks to the bus arriving at just the right moment,)</font>

1103
00:26:18,050 --> 00:26:19,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they're closing in on the other team.)</font>

1104
00:26:19,020 --> 00:26:21,320
<font size="64">Straight forward. That's where we need to go.</font>

1105
00:26:19,850 --> 00:26:23,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, Team Car is finally getting close to the bridge.)</font>

1106
00:26:21,550 --> 00:26:22,790
<font size="64">We haven't crossed the river yet.</font>

1107
00:26:22,790 --> 00:26:23,950
<font size="64">- Have we? - Not yet.</font>

1108
00:26:23,950 --> 00:26:25,260
<font size="64">- Not yet? - Yes, go straight forward.</font>

1109
00:26:25,260 --> 00:26:27,260
<font size="64">All right. Keep going straight.</font>

1110
00:26:27,360 --> 00:26:28,590
<font size="64">We haven't crossed the bridge yet.</font>

1111
00:26:28,590 --> 00:26:29,960
<font size="64">Is the river on the right or the left?</font>

1112
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:31,900
<font size="64">It's on both sides, dummy.</font>

1113
00:26:31,900 --> 00:26:33,230
<font size="64">- Oh, right. - It's a bridge.</font>

1114
00:26:33,260 --> 00:26:34,970
<font size="64">- Jong Kook, please. - Gosh, I'm sorry.</font>

1115
00:26:34,970 --> 00:26:36,630
<font size="64">- I'm so sorry. - Was that necessary?</font>

1116
00:26:35,070 --> 00:26:37,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A fool looking for only one side of the river)</font>

1117
00:26:36,630 --> 00:26:38,870
<font size="64">- I didn't mean it like that. - But it's on the right here.</font>

1118
00:26:38,870 --> 00:26:40,340
<font size="64">- That was a cute question. - But...</font>

1119
00:26:40,340 --> 00:26:42,470
<font size="64">- "Which side is the river?" - Because of us...</font>

1120
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:45,540
<font size="64">She's holding the map upside down,</font>

1121
00:26:45,540 --> 00:26:47,040
<font size="64">so the river's on the right.</font>

1122
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:47,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The map is upside down.)</font>

1123
00:26:47,040 --> 00:26:50,510
<font size="64">Eun Bi, whenever you cross a bridge, you see the river on both sides.</font>

1124
00:26:47,510 --> 00:26:50,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(You have to look at the map this way.)</font>

1125
00:26:50,750 --> 00:26:53,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Embarrassed)</font>

1126
00:26:51,310 --> 00:26:52,820
<font size="64">- Because we're crossing the river. - It's all right.</font>

1127
00:26:52,820 --> 00:26:55,050
<font size="64">- Left and right. - That's not what I meant.</font>

1128
00:26:55,050 --> 00:26:56,850
<font size="64">- That was so cute. - A little thought goes a long way.</font>

1129
00:26:56,850 --> 00:26:59,420
<font size="64">- It's all right. - So this is where we're going.</font>

1130
00:26:57,990 --> 00:27:00,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Now, this is how you look at the map properly.)</font>

1131
00:26:59,420 --> 00:27:01,120
<font size="64">That's it. We need to cross the bridge.</font>

1132
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:03,730
<font size="64">We're on our way from the cafe.</font>

1133
00:27:01,590 --> 00:27:05,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Assistant Kwon isn't used to reading paper maps.)</font>

1134
00:27:03,730 --> 00:27:05,600
<font size="64">- We've made it this far. - I see.</font>

1135
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:07,530
<font size="64">We might lose at this rate.</font>

1136
00:27:07,530 --> 00:27:10,230
<font size="64">Anyway, we trust Eun Bi, so we'll let her guide us.</font>

1137
00:27:08,330 --> 00:27:11,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She's off to a bad start.)</font>

1138
00:27:10,230 --> 00:27:11,970
<font size="64">- Sure. - Okay, good.</font>

1139
00:27:11,970 --> 00:27:14,070
<font size="64">Will we be crossing it soon?</font>

1140
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:17,210
<font size="64">Wait. I think this is Gayang Bridge.</font>

1141
00:27:17,210 --> 00:27:18,210
<font size="64">That's right.</font>

1142
00:27:17,810 --> 00:27:21,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They enter Gayang Bridge, with the river on both sides.)</font>

1143
00:27:18,210 --> 00:27:19,710
<font size="64">- Yes, it is. - I'm right.</font>

1144
00:27:19,710 --> 00:27:21,240
<font size="64">We're still staying on course.</font>

1145
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:23,610
<font size="64">- After we cross it... - After we cross it?</font>

1146
00:27:23,610 --> 00:27:26,020
<font size="64">- We'll cross the bridge first. - Right.</font>

1147
00:27:23,710 --> 00:27:26,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kindly explaining again)</font>

1148
00:27:26,050 --> 00:27:27,750
<font size="64">- We're almost there. - Not the 1st right, but the 2nd.</font>

1149
00:27:27,750 --> 00:27:28,990
<font size="64">- Yes, the second. - Right.</font>

1150
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:35,960
<font size="64">Should we be looking for a drive-through place?</font>

1151
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:37,790
<font size="64">It's been a while since I was on the show.</font>

1152
00:27:37,790 --> 00:27:41,130
<font size="64">Still, I'd understand if you hadn't eaten but...</font>

1153
00:27:39,130 --> 00:27:41,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(With 30 minutes to spare, she looks for a drive-through cafe.)</font>

1154
00:27:41,330 --> 00:27:43,530
<font size="64">- Is the other team on its way? - Where is it?</font>

1155
00:27:44,130 --> 00:27:46,040
<font size="64">- There can't be a direct bus. - Right.</font>

1156
00:27:46,040 --> 00:27:47,440
<font size="64">I doubt there's a direct bus.</font>

1157
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:48,570
<font size="64">Is that so?</font>

1158
00:27:48,610 --> 00:27:49,940
<font size="64">- Not here. - It's not this one,</font>

1159
00:27:48,710 --> 00:27:52,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Car stops by a drive-through cafe without knowing the situation.)</font>

1160
00:27:49,940 --> 00:27:51,740
<font size="64">- but the next one. - Right.</font>

1161
00:27:51,910 --> 00:27:54,040
<font size="64">Wait. Where's the drive-through? I don't think they have that option.</font>

1162
00:27:54,040 --> 00:27:55,280
<font size="64">Right here. On the left.</font>

1163
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:56,650
<font size="64">- Is it here? - Yes, go here.</font>

1164
00:27:56,080 --> 00:27:58,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Following her lead,)</font>

1165
00:27:56,650 --> 00:27:58,010
<font size="64">I can't believe you spotted that.</font>

1166
00:27:58,010 --> 00:27:59,250
<font size="64">What are you getting?</font>

1167
00:27:58,580 --> 00:28:00,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they arrive at a drive-through cafe.)</font>

1168
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:01,020
<font size="64">Well...</font>

1169
00:28:01,020 --> 00:28:02,250
<font size="64">Bacon...</font>

1170
00:28:02,250 --> 00:28:04,520
<font size="64">Ji Hyo, I thought you weren't getting anything.</font>

1171
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:05,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She feels hungry now.)</font>

1172
00:28:04,520 --> 00:28:06,060
<font size="64">- I... - I want an egg McMuffin.</font>

1173
00:28:06,060 --> 00:28:09,530
<font size="64">- And? - Jeju green mandarin McFizz for me.</font>

1174
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:12,800
<font size="64">And four Oreo McFlurries.</font>

1175
00:28:13,030 --> 00:28:14,160
<font size="64">A box of chicken tenders.</font>

1176
00:28:13,230 --> 00:28:16,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A massive order)</font>

1177
00:28:14,160 --> 00:28:15,330
<font size="64">She wants chicken tenders.</font>

1178
00:28:15,330 --> 00:28:16,970
<font size="64">- Would two pieces be okay? - Yes.</font>

1179
00:28:16,970 --> 00:28:19,370
<font size="64">- Thank you. - Thank you. Take care.</font>

1180
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:20,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They get exactly what they wished for.)</font>

1181
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:22,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Nervous)</font>

1182
00:28:20,240 --> 00:28:21,870
<font size="64">Are you sure this is allowed?</font>

1183
00:28:22,140 --> 00:28:23,370
<font size="64">I think we'll still...</font>

1184
00:28:23,370 --> 00:28:24,610
<font size="64">- get there first. - We'll probably win.</font>

1185
00:28:24,610 --> 00:28:26,140
<font size="64">- Besides, - The map isn't very helpful.</font>

1186
00:28:26,140 --> 00:28:27,680
<font size="64">I'm always lucky on Running Man.</font>

1187
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,050
<font size="64">- Right. - The other team...</font>

1188
00:28:28,450 --> 00:28:32,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They can take it easy since they have a car of their own.)</font>

1189
00:28:29,050 --> 00:28:30,450
<font size="64">probably has it rough.</font>

1190
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:33,420
<font size="64">They need to figure out which bus to take and then wait.</font>

1191
00:28:33,450 --> 00:28:34,580
<font size="64">Hello.</font>

1192
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:37,150
<font size="64">- That looks so good. - How are you doing?</font>

1193
00:28:35,050 --> 00:28:37,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Happily picking up their order)</font>

1194
00:28:37,150 --> 00:28:38,490
<font size="64">- That looks good. - Thank you.</font>

1195
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:39,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Excited)</font>

1196
00:28:38,490 --> 00:28:39,790
<font size="64">We need Eun Bi's drink.</font>

1197
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:41,360
<font size="64">- Excuse me. - Thank you.</font>

1198
00:28:41,360 --> 00:28:42,360
<font size="64">Can we get some napkins...</font>

1199
00:28:42,360 --> 00:28:43,430
<font size="64">- Napkins. - And wet wipes.</font>

1200
00:28:43,430 --> 00:28:45,500
<font size="64">Can we get four wet wipes?</font>

1201
00:28:43,590 --> 00:28:45,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ordering more)</font>

1202
00:28:45,500 --> 00:28:47,530
<font size="64">- Wet wipes, please. - Get two packets of ketchup.</font>

1203
00:28:47,530 --> 00:28:50,030
<font size="64">They'd like two packets of ketchup.</font>

1204
00:28:50,500 --> 00:28:52,140
<font size="64">This is definitely a first.</font>

1205
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:53,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mr. Free Meals is happy about the quick snack break.)</font>

1206
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:53,170
<font size="64">Thank you.</font>

1207
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,870
<font size="64">- Thank you. - Thank you.</font>

1208
00:28:54,870 --> 00:28:56,640
<font size="64">- Nice. - All set? Let's go.</font>

1209
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:58,140
<font size="64">- Come on, let's go! - Let's go, guys.</font>

1210
00:28:58,140 --> 00:28:59,140
<font size="64">Let's go.</font>

1211
00:28:59,140 --> 00:29:01,040
<font size="64">Deja deja vu</font>

1212
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:04,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Off they go, humming her song.)</font>

1213
00:29:01,740 --> 00:29:03,280
<font size="64">Deja deja vu</font>

1214
00:29:03,280 --> 00:29:04,350
<font size="64">That's it.</font>

1215
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:08,490
<font size="64">Wasn't there a famous song called "Deja Vu?"</font>

1216
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:08,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Taking a bite of a burger)</font>

1217
00:29:08,950 --> 00:29:11,250
<font size="64">- There's a movie by that title. - Is it a movie?</font>

1218
00:29:09,190 --> 00:29:13,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're taking their time snacking in the morning.)</font>

1219
00:29:11,250 --> 00:29:12,290
<font size="64">- There's a song too. - What?</font>

1220
00:29:12,290 --> 00:29:14,360
<font size="64">- Really? - I'll keep yours here, Jong Kook.</font>

1221
00:29:14,360 --> 00:29:16,590
<font size="64">All right. We need to make a U-turn.</font>

1222
00:29:16,590 --> 00:29:18,530
<font size="64">- Yes, make a U-turn. - Right?</font>

1223
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:21,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Assistant Kwon takes a sip.)</font>

1224
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:20,700
<font size="64">Gosh, it's so good.</font>

1225
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:23,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

1226
00:29:22,430 --> 00:29:24,130
<font size="64">- It's really good. - I know.</font>

1227
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:25,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Satisfied)</font>

1228
00:29:24,130 --> 00:29:25,140
<font size="64">That's so cute.</font>

1229
00:29:25,140 --> 00:29:28,140
<font size="64">It's so sweet and nice. This is insane.</font>

1230
00:29:25,900 --> 00:29:29,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Team Car comfortably leaves the drive-through,)</font>

1231
00:29:29,210 --> 00:29:32,410
<font size="64">Seok Jin, I don't think we've crossed Gayang Bridge yet.</font>

1232
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:33,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Bus hasn't reached the bridge yet.)</font>

1233
00:29:32,410 --> 00:29:34,980
<font size="64">Wait. We have to cross Gayang Bridge first.</font>

1234
00:29:35,150 --> 00:29:37,150
<font size="64">We need to cross Gayang Bridge.</font>

1235
00:29:37,150 --> 00:29:38,150
<font size="64">- Right. - We're doing just that.</font>

1236
00:29:38,150 --> 00:29:40,080
<font size="64">- It's crossing the bridge. - It must circle back that way.</font>

1237
00:29:38,780 --> 00:29:43,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're finally crossing Gayang Bridge!)</font>

1238
00:29:40,080 --> 00:29:41,150
<font size="64">- Here we go. - Okay.</font>

1239
00:29:41,150 --> 00:29:42,750
<font size="64">- And then... - Yes?</font>

1240
00:29:43,150 --> 00:29:45,390
<font size="64">After we cross Gayang Bridge,</font>

1241
00:29:43,450 --> 00:29:47,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Jae Seok, Gayang Bridge)</font>

1242
00:29:45,390 --> 00:29:47,660
<font size="64">we can get off two stops later.</font>

1243
00:29:47,990 --> 00:29:51,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they catch up with Team Car, who are taking their time?)</font>

1244
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:49,630
<font size="64">If the bus turns right instead of going forward,</font>

1245
00:29:49,630 --> 00:29:51,160
<font size="64">let's get off right away.</font>

1246
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:53,260
<font size="64">- Sure. - Okay, got it.</font>

1247
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:56,200
<font size="64">What do you say to a try-not-to-laugh challenge?</font>

1248
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chuckling)</font>

1249
00:29:58,230 --> 00:29:59,640
<font size="64">But you just laughed.</font>

1250
00:29:59,700 --> 00:30:00,970
<font size="64">- You see... - Is it over then?</font>

1251
00:30:00,970 --> 00:30:03,040
<font size="64">- This isn't a private bus. - Right.</font>

1252
00:30:03,040 --> 00:30:04,440
<font size="64">Seok Jin, humor Won Hun, will you?</font>

1253
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,280
<font size="64">It's not that. He said that while chuckling.</font>

1254
00:30:05,240 --> 00:30:07,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Superstar Jee is giving the newbie a hard time.)</font>

1255
00:30:06,280 --> 00:30:07,440
<font size="64">I didn't know.</font>

1256
00:30:07,410 --> 00:30:09,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Disappointed)</font>

1257
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,850
<font size="64">- I wasn't aware of the rules. - Humor him a little.</font>

1258
00:30:09,650 --> 00:30:11,450
<font size="64">- I mean... - Variety shows aren't easy.</font>

1259
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:15,420
<font size="64">- He's a 30th-generation comedian. - What?</font>

1260
00:30:15,350 --> 00:30:17,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Won Hun joined KBS as part of its 30th open recruitment class.)</font>

1261
00:30:15,420 --> 00:30:17,450
<font size="64">- Are you from the 30th generation? - That's right.</font>

1262
00:30:17,450 --> 00:30:19,760
<font size="64">- Isn't Jae Seok from the 7th? - He's from the 7th.</font>

1263
00:30:19,690 --> 00:30:21,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(KBS's 30th, 10th, and 7th recruitment classes)</font>

1264
00:30:19,760 --> 00:30:20,960
<font size="64">I'm from the tenth.</font>

1265
00:30:21,190 --> 00:30:23,330
<font size="64">- Tenth? - Along with Song Eun I...</font>

1266
00:30:21,990 --> 00:30:24,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A 20-year difference between Won Hun and Seok Jin)</font>

1267
00:30:23,330 --> 00:30:24,860
<font size="64">- and others. - He's a year above them.</font>

1268
00:30:24,860 --> 00:30:27,260
<font size="64">Weren't the odds just 2 to 1...</font>

1269
00:30:27,530 --> 00:30:29,200
<font size="64">back then?</font>

1270
00:30:29,500 --> 00:30:31,500
<font size="64">Seok Sam wasn't a regular recruit.</font>

1271
00:30:31,500 --> 00:30:32,900
<font size="64">- I'm a special recruit. - He's a special recruit.</font>

1272
00:30:32,900 --> 00:30:34,400
<font size="64">- A special recruit? - He had connections.</font>

1273
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:37,270
<font size="64">Later on, he became part of the tenth generation of comedians.</font>

1274
00:30:35,470 --> 00:30:38,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's the only one who joined KBS through special recruitment.)</font>

1275
00:30:37,440 --> 00:30:38,910
<font size="64">- He's a special recruit. - I'm a special recruit too.</font>

1276
00:30:38,340 --> 00:30:40,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(SBS's 8th special recruitment class)</font>

1277
00:30:38,910 --> 00:30:41,340
<font size="64">Are you a special recruit? I should care for you more now.</font>

1278
00:30:41,340 --> 00:30:42,780
<font size="64">- Now... - Only now?</font>

1279
00:30:42,250 --> 00:30:44,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He starts caring about him after 10 years...)</font>

1280
00:30:42,780 --> 00:30:44,650
<font size="64">Jae Seok, Seok Jin just hugged me.</font>

1281
00:30:44,080 --> 00:30:45,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(only because he found out he was a special recruit.)</font>

1282
00:30:44,650 --> 00:30:46,950
<font size="64">- For the first time in ten years... - I should care more for him.</font>

1283
00:30:46,950 --> 00:30:48,990
<font size="64">We're on a public bus. Please keep it down.</font>

1284
00:30:48,990 --> 00:30:51,490
<font size="64">Haven't you done this before? We need to keep it down.</font>

1285
00:30:49,190 --> 00:30:51,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The open-crecruit is keeping the special recruit in check.)</font>

1286
00:30:51,490 --> 00:30:52,860
<font size="64">- Anyway... - There are other passengers.</font>

1287
00:30:51,850 --> 00:30:52,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Glaring)</font>

1288
00:30:52,860 --> 00:30:54,960
<font size="64">- Are you patronizing me? - Well, I'm the senior comedian.</font>

1289
00:30:52,990 --> 00:30:54,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Worked up)</font>

1290
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:58,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's got one ally, but he still can't stand up for himself.)</font>

1291
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:56,330
<font size="64">- I guess you're right. - Even as a special recruit,</font>

1292
00:30:56,330 --> 00:30:57,730
<font size="64">you should respect him.</font>

1293
00:30:57,730 --> 00:30:59,130
<font size="64">- I'm the senior comedian. - If you don't respect him,</font>

1294
00:30:58,260 --> 00:31:00,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calm down.)</font>

1295
00:30:59,130 --> 00:31:00,530
<font size="64">- That's true. - Won Hun will disrespect me.</font>

1296
00:31:00,530 --> 00:31:03,230
<font size="64">As a regular recruit, I know to keep quiet in public.</font>

1297
00:31:03,500 --> 00:31:04,530
<font size="64">- I don't want to... - Because you're a regular recruit?</font>

1298
00:31:04,530 --> 00:31:05,570
<font size="64">inconvenience anyone.</font>

1299
00:31:05,900 --> 00:31:08,040
<font size="64">Special recruits talk a lot even in public places.</font>

1300
00:31:08,070 --> 00:31:09,610
<font size="64">Special recruits, you say?</font>

1301
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:11,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's preparing his next attack without talking back.)</font>

1302
00:31:09,610 --> 00:31:11,140
<font size="64">I wasn't trying to disrespect you.</font>

1303
00:31:11,140 --> 00:31:12,740
<font size="64">But regular recruits...</font>

1304
00:31:13,010 --> 00:31:15,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Trying to attack)</font>

1305
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:15,280
<font size="64">- It's the opposite. - By the way, what's your job?</font>

1306
00:31:15,850 --> 00:31:16,850
<font size="64">- Me? - Yes.</font>

1307
00:31:16,850 --> 00:31:17,850
<font size="64">I haven't seen anything you've done.</font>

1308
00:31:18,080 --> 00:31:20,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Targeting his popularity)</font>

1309
00:31:19,850 --> 00:31:21,180
<font size="64">Seok Jin, what do you mainly do?</font>

1310
00:31:21,180 --> 00:31:24,120
<font size="64">All sorts of things. I even have my own business.</font>

1311
00:31:24,820 --> 00:31:26,760
<font size="64">Seok Jin, come on.</font>

1312
00:31:25,490 --> 00:31:29,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He tried to attack, but ended up getting hit by his own arrow.)</font>

1313
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:28,260
<font size="64">You seem upset.</font>

1314
00:31:28,260 --> 00:31:30,330
<font size="64">- You lost, Seok Jin. - What do you mean?</font>

1315
00:31:30,330 --> 00:31:31,730
<font size="64">- You really lost. - Seok Jin.</font>

1316
00:31:31,630 --> 00:31:33,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Let go of me.)</font>

1317
00:31:31,730 --> 00:31:33,160
<font size="64">You're not helping yourself.</font>

1318
00:31:33,430 --> 00:31:35,060
<font size="64">- Talk to me instead. - I currently do...</font>

1319
00:31:33,530 --> 00:31:36,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Clenching his teeth)</font>

1320
00:31:35,060 --> 00:31:36,730
<font size="64">- a lot of things. - You're good at what you do.</font>

1321
00:31:36,730 --> 00:31:38,840
<font size="64">That's enough, guys. He might pass out from rage.</font>

1322
00:31:36,970 --> 00:31:38,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After just a few words in,)</font>

1323
00:31:38,670 --> 00:31:40,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(and his blood pressure is already skyrocketing.)</font>

1324
00:31:38,870 --> 00:31:40,770
<font size="64">- That's not it. - Stop it.</font>

1325
00:31:40,770 --> 00:31:43,240
<font size="64">- He got on Seok Jin's nerves. - He got under Seok Jin's skin.</font>

1326
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:46,110
<font size="64">Anyway, what do you even do?</font>

1327
00:31:46,140 --> 00:31:48,240
<font size="64">Right now, I'm on Running Man.</font>

1328
00:31:46,140 --> 00:31:48,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Talking without hesitation)</font>

1329
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:50,280
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - I'm not angry at all.</font>

1330
00:31:48,850 --> 00:31:51,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Flapping)</font>

1331
00:31:50,280 --> 00:31:52,280
<font size="64">- I'm not angry. - Don't you think...</font>

1332
00:31:52,280 --> 00:31:54,750
<font size="64">- that's the same as being angry? - Is this a normal conversation?</font>

1333
00:31:54,750 --> 00:31:56,250
<font size="64">I'm not angry. Look, I'm even smiling.</font>

1334
00:31:55,690 --> 00:31:57,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A fake smile)</font>

1335
00:31:56,250 --> 00:31:58,150
<font size="64">Take it slow, okay? We have all day.</font>

1336
00:31:58,150 --> 00:32:01,360
<font size="64">I'm well aware that this is how he talks to people.</font>

1337
00:31:58,990 --> 00:32:01,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's figured out how to get on Seok Sam's nerves.)</font>

1338
00:32:01,360 --> 00:32:03,860
<font size="64">He looks better on camera, doesn't he?</font>

1339
00:32:01,690 --> 00:32:04,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 2nd attempt)</font>

1340
00:32:03,860 --> 00:32:05,430
<font size="64">- He looks better on camera. - Wait.</font>

1341
00:32:04,190 --> 00:32:07,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He switches tactics and goes after his looks instead.)</font>

1342
00:32:05,430 --> 00:32:07,330
<font size="64">- Are you making this personal? - That's not it.</font>

1343
00:32:07,330 --> 00:32:08,970
<font size="64">I, for one, look better in person.</font>

1344
00:32:08,970 --> 00:32:10,430
<font size="64">What are your thoughts on Seok Jin?</font>

1345
00:32:10,430 --> 00:32:13,470
<font size="64">When I first saw you,</font>

1346
00:32:13,700 --> 00:32:15,570
<font size="64">I thought...</font>

1347
00:32:16,410 --> 00:32:19,440
<font size="64">I won't say anymore.</font>

1348
00:32:19,610 --> 00:32:21,010
<font size="64">Seok Jin, you should take a break.</font>

1349
00:32:20,210 --> 00:32:21,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calm down.)</font>

1350
00:32:21,010 --> 00:32:22,750
<font size="64">He's just making no sense.</font>

1351
00:32:23,010 --> 00:32:24,180
<font size="64">- I mean... - Just take a break.</font>

1352
00:32:23,550 --> 00:32:27,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He loses whenever he comes at someone.)</font>

1353
00:32:24,180 --> 00:32:25,250
<font size="64">Everything he says...</font>

1354
00:32:25,250 --> 00:32:27,720
<font size="64">- is so random. - Won Hun, look the other way.</font>

1355
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:30,890
<font size="64">- Seok Jin's... - It shouldn't be so random.</font>

1356
00:32:31,150 --> 00:32:32,890
<font size="64">I bet it itches here.</font>

1357
00:32:32,790 --> 00:32:33,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Scratching)</font>

1358
00:32:35,460 --> 00:32:38,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He can't win the argument, so he resorts to force.)</font>

1359
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:38,730
<font size="64">Seok Jin, please. We're on a bus.</font>

1360
00:32:38,800 --> 00:32:40,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sighing)</font>

1361
00:32:39,530 --> 00:32:41,430
<font size="64">- Won Hun, don't. - That's enough.</font>

1362
00:32:41,430 --> 00:32:43,970
<font size="64">At this rate, you'll pass out from rage.</font>

1363
00:32:43,970 --> 00:32:45,840
<font size="64">- Pace yourself. - But...</font>

1364
00:32:46,440 --> 00:32:48,500
<font size="64">Seok Jin, I thought you were pretty decent.</font>

1365
00:32:48,840 --> 00:32:50,710
<font size="64">Who scratches someone's head with a camera like that?</font>

1366
00:32:50,710 --> 00:32:52,140
<font size="64">I stood up to applaud when you won a Blue Dragon Award.</font>

1367
00:32:52,140 --> 00:32:53,610
<font size="64">I thought you were decent too.</font>

1368
00:32:53,610 --> 00:32:54,680
<font size="64">I never asked you to.</font>

1369
00:32:55,650 --> 00:32:58,350
<font size="64">I applauded you. You brat.</font>

1370
00:32:55,780 --> 00:32:58,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He finally snapped.)</font>

1371
00:32:58,410 --> 00:32:59,820
<font size="64">I mean... No, don't hold me back.</font>

1372
00:32:58,580 --> 00:33:00,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A mess)</font>

1373
00:33:00,850 --> 00:33:02,250
<font size="64">Pace yourself, Won Hun.</font>

1374
00:33:02,250 --> 00:33:04,220
<font size="64">We should talk off the bus.</font>

1375
00:33:02,690 --> 00:33:06,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calling for a truce)</font>

1376
00:33:04,220 --> 00:33:06,020
<font size="64">Right now, emotions are running high.</font>

1377
00:33:06,020 --> 00:33:07,620
<font size="64">Wait, is it over there?</font>

1378
00:33:06,460 --> 00:33:07,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hitting)</font>

1379
00:33:07,960 --> 00:33:10,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Truce negotiations break down.)</font>

1380
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:10,430
<font size="64">- No, it's past there. - I see.</font>

1381
00:33:10,430 --> 00:33:11,890
<font size="64">We have to go straight down...</font>

1382
00:33:10,830 --> 00:33:15,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The way these middle-aged men fight is embarrassing.)</font>

1383
00:33:11,890 --> 00:33:14,400
<font size="64">- and make a turn. - I think it's that way.</font>

1384
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:16,900
<font size="64">You lost, Seok Jin. That's enough.</font>

