<font size="64">- That's amazing! - My instincts...</font>

1775
00:42:08,460 --> 00:42:12,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Won Hun, the one who chose blue, takes all the prizes.)</font>

1776
00:42:09,230 --> 00:42:11,370
<font size="64">- My instincts were spot on! - Everyone chose red?</font>

1777
00:42:11,370 --> 00:42:12,870
<font size="64">They were really good.</font>

1778
00:42:13,970 --> 00:42:16,110
<font size="64">I thought you'd all give it a twist.</font>

1779
00:42:16,110 --> 00:42:17,140
<font size="64">Okay!</font>

1780
00:42:17,170 --> 00:42:19,340
<font size="64">- But I'll... - I thought you'd give it a twist.</font>

1781
00:42:19,410 --> 00:42:21,710
<font size="64">give up the prizes and become a regular on Running Man.</font>

1782
00:42:22,540 --> 00:42:23,580
<font size="64">I won't take them.</font>

1783
00:42:23,580 --> 00:42:25,110
<font size="64">Didn't you say that on "Hangout with Yoo?"</font>

1784
00:42:25,110 --> 00:42:26,920
<font size="64">I think I fit in better here than on "Hangout with Yoo."</font>

1785
00:42:27,450 --> 00:42:29,180
<font size="64">But how could you be the only one...</font>

1786
00:42:29,180 --> 00:42:30,490
<font size="64">- Won Hun! - All of them?</font>

1787
00:42:31,290 --> 00:42:33,260
<font size="64">I thought you'd give it a twist. Why didn't you?</font>

1788
00:42:33,260 --> 00:42:34,660
<font size="64">I gave it two twists.</font>

1789
00:42:34,690 --> 00:42:36,730
<font size="64">- I twisted your twisted decision. - I gave it two twists.</font>

1790
00:42:35,930 --> 00:42:38,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Odysseus Jee's mind game confused them.)</font>

1791
00:42:36,730 --> 00:42:38,060
<font size="64">- I twisted your twisted decision. - How nice.</font>

1792
00:42:38,230 --> 00:42:41,060
<font size="64">- I should check if it's real. - That's amazing.</font>

1793
00:42:41,060 --> 00:42:42,460
<font size="64">It's real.</font>

1794
00:42:43,030 --> 00:42:44,400
<font size="64">Goodness.</font>

1795
00:42:43,100 --> 00:42:45,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jealous)</font>

1796
00:42:44,730 --> 00:42:46,770
<font size="64">- There could be one more person. - Right.</font>

1797
00:42:46,770 --> 00:42:47,900
<font size="64">- Yes. Let's move... - Thank you.</font>

1798
00:42:47,900 --> 00:42:49,040
<font size="64">- to the next location. - Okay!</font>

1799
00:42:49,040 --> 00:42:50,270
<font size="64">- Okay! - Okay.</font>

1800
00:42:49,770 --> 00:42:53,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He heads to the next mission spot with his arms full of prizes.)</font>

1801
00:42:50,640 --> 00:42:52,170
<font size="64">- Good job. - Thank you.</font>

1802
00:42:52,170 --> 00:42:53,380
<font size="64">- Thank you. - That's amazing.</font>

1803
00:42:53,580 --> 00:42:55,440
<font size="64">- Right here. - What is this place?</font>

1804
00:42:53,910 --> 00:42:56,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The next mission will take place at a studio in Deungchon.)</font>

1805
00:42:55,980 --> 00:42:57,980
<font size="64">It's really huge.</font>

1806
00:42:57,580 --> 00:43:00,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A ball is placed on a large mat.)</font>

1807
00:42:58,210 --> 00:42:59,450
<font size="64">- What is this? - What is this?</font>

1808
00:42:59,550 --> 00:43:01,020
<font size="64">They drew a line.</font>

1809
00:43:01,020 --> 00:43:02,790
<font size="64">I wonder what we'll be doing. Dodge ball?</font>

1810
00:43:02,820 --> 00:43:03,920
<font size="64">I wonder.</font>

1811
00:43:03,620 --> 00:43:06,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What's the next mission that is likely to be a test of strength?)</font>

1812
00:43:03,990 --> 00:43:05,150
<font size="64">Hold on. This...</font>

1813
00:43:05,250 --> 00:43:06,320
<font size="64">This mission...</font>

1814
00:43:06,320 --> 00:43:08,790
<font size="64">puts both the prizes and the meal on the line.</font>

1815
00:43:08,820 --> 00:43:10,590
<font size="64">It's called Lunch. Take it? Leave it?</font>

1816
00:43:09,490 --> 00:43:11,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mission 2: Lunch. Take it? Leave it?)</font>

1817
00:43:10,630 --> 00:43:12,290
<font size="64">- What is it? - Take it? Leave it?</font>

1818
00:43:12,290 --> 00:43:13,700
<font size="64">- Leave it, leave it. - Take it or leave it?</font>

1819
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:16,700
<font size="64">You'll play a 2-on-2 dodge ball match...</font>

1820
00:43:16,700 --> 00:43:18,500
<font size="64">with each player tied to a player of the opposing team.</font>

1821
00:43:18,500 --> 00:43:19,700
<font size="64">- Dodge ball? - Yes.</font>

1822
00:43:19,770 --> 00:43:21,900
<font size="64">If you get hit by the ball thrown by the opposing team,</font>

1823
00:43:21,840 --> 00:43:23,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Losing 1 point)</font>

1824
00:43:21,900 --> 00:43:23,670
<font size="64">you lose one point.</font>

1825
00:43:23,840 --> 00:43:25,240
<font size="64">You won't get eliminated.</font>

1826
00:43:25,770 --> 00:43:27,840
<font size="64">You'll have three minutes per round.</font>

1827
00:43:28,080 --> 00:43:30,450
<font size="64">You'll play three rounds, and the team...</font>

1828
00:43:30,450 --> 00:43:32,250
<font size="64">- with the higher score wins. - Yes.</font>

1829
00:43:32,250 --> 00:43:35,220
<font size="64">Okay. The winning team will receive a prize...</font>

1830
00:43:35,220 --> 00:43:36,750
<font size="64">- and a hearty Korean meal. - Okay!</font>

1831
00:43:36,820 --> 00:43:38,920
<font size="64">- I'm already jealous. I'm starving. - Okay!</font>

1832
00:43:39,050 --> 00:43:41,320
<font size="64">The losing team will just eat rice with kimchi.</font>

1833
00:43:42,190 --> 00:43:43,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's the worst.)</font>

1834
00:43:43,690 --> 00:43:45,890
<font size="64">- But you had McDonald's. - We already ate a lot.</font>

1835
00:43:44,060 --> 00:43:47,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Car had McDonald's.)</font>

1836
00:43:45,890 --> 00:43:47,500
<font size="64">- Did you eat something? - They had McDonald's.</font>

1837
00:43:47,500 --> 00:43:48,500
<font size="64">Yes, they ate.</font>

1838
00:43:47,860 --> 00:43:49,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Looking at him nervously)</font>

1839
00:43:48,500 --> 00:43:49,900
<font size="64">- Seriously? - I'm starving.</font>

1840
00:43:49,900 --> 00:43:51,230
<font size="64">I mean... Come on.</font>

1841
00:43:50,500 --> 00:43:52,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling betrayed)</font>

1842
00:43:51,230 --> 00:43:52,630
<font size="64">We've already divided you into teams.</font>

1843
00:43:52,900 --> 00:43:54,900
<font size="64">Jae Seok, Seok Jin, Se Chan, and Eun Bi.</font>

1844
00:43:54,000 --> 00:43:58,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Orange: Jae Seok, Seok Jin, Se Chan, Eun Bi)</font>

1845
00:43:54,900 --> 00:43:56,170
<font size="64">- Please stand together. - Sure.</font>

1846
00:43:56,210 --> 00:43:57,370
<font size="64">Jae Seok, Seok Jin, and Eun Bi.</font>

1847
00:43:57,370 --> 00:43:58,470
<font size="64">- That's right. - We've already won.</font>

1848
00:43:58,510 --> 00:44:01,110
<font size="64">Haha, Won Hun, Jong Kook, Ye Eun, and Ji Hyo are a team.</font>

1849
00:43:59,270 --> 00:44:03,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Pink: Won Hun, Ji Hyo, Jong Kook, Ye Eun, Haha)</font>

1850
00:44:01,110 --> 00:44:02,510
<font size="64">- We've already won. - Won Hun's pretty sporty.</font>

1851
00:44:02,510 --> 00:44:03,650
<font size="64">I'm pretty fast.</font>

1852
00:44:03,650 --> 00:44:05,180
<font size="64">- You have no idea. - I'm pretty fast.</font>

1853
00:44:03,980 --> 00:44:05,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Smug)</font>

1854
00:44:05,180 --> 00:44:06,850
<font size="64">- Are you serious? - I'm quick on my feet.</font>

1855
00:44:06,850 --> 00:44:07,880
<font size="64">- He's good at soccer. - I've got speed.</font>

1856
00:44:07,880 --> 00:44:08,950
<font size="64">- Really? - He's really good.</font>

1857
00:44:09,080 --> 00:44:11,290
<font size="64">These are the matchups for round one.</font>

1858
00:44:09,890 --> 00:44:11,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Round 1 Matchups)</font>

1859
00:44:11,290 --> 00:44:12,960
<font size="64">Jae Seok and Seok Jin versus Haha and Won Hun.</font>

1860
00:44:11,590 --> 00:44:14,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Orange: Jae Seok, Seok Jin, Team Pink: Haha, Won Hun)</font>

1861
00:44:12,990 --> 00:44:14,090
<font size="64">- Right, round one. - Got it.</font>

1862
00:44:14,090 --> 00:44:15,390
<font size="64">- Okay. - Let's go!</font>

1863
00:44:15,390 --> 00:44:16,730
<font size="64">- We've already won. - You'll put on your gear first.</font>

1864
00:44:16,390 --> 00:44:18,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They put on team vests.)</font>

1865
00:44:16,730 --> 00:44:17,790
<font size="64">- Sure. - Please wear your vests.</font>

1866
00:44:19,190 --> 00:44:20,830
<font size="64">- Won Hun, can you get ours too? - Sure.</font>

1867
00:44:22,160 --> 00:44:23,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ignoring)</font>

1868
00:44:23,230 --> 00:44:24,230
<font size="64">You didn't hear me.</font>

1869
00:44:24,430 --> 00:44:25,800
<font size="64">Aren't you too young to lose your hearing?</font>

1870
00:44:25,970 --> 00:44:27,740
<font size="64">- Already... - Here you go.</font>

1871
00:44:26,970 --> 00:44:30,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's still sore about what happened on the bus.)</font>

1872
00:44:27,740 --> 00:44:29,070
<font size="64">- Thanks. - You must see him as a threat.</font>

1873
00:44:30,310 --> 00:44:31,610
<font size="64">Seok Jin sees him as a threat.</font>

1874
00:44:31,670 --> 00:44:32,980
<font size="64">Seok Jin...</font>

1875
00:44:33,210 --> 00:44:34,280
<font size="64">Okay, nice.</font>

1876
00:44:34,310 --> 00:44:35,910
<font size="64">I just like him, that's all.</font>

1877
00:44:36,580 --> 00:44:39,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Smirking)</font>

1878
00:44:37,250 --> 00:44:39,180
<font size="64">- I think it's one-sided. - For someone who likes him...</font>

1879
00:44:39,580 --> 00:44:41,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The two rivals are tied together by a rope.)</font>

1880
00:44:41,250 --> 00:44:42,950
<font size="64">- I mean... - So what will it be?</font>

1881
00:44:42,950 --> 00:44:44,690
<font size="64">I don't want to shock him with my strength.</font>

1882
00:44:45,390 --> 00:44:48,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Smirking)</font>

1883
00:44:45,690 --> 00:44:47,660
<font size="64">Should I show a little respect?</font>

1884
00:44:48,320 --> 00:44:50,260
<font size="64">I hate that. Why is that necessary?</font>

1885
00:44:48,420 --> 00:44:51,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Annoyed)</font>

1886
00:44:50,460 --> 00:44:51,760
<font size="64">- Should I do it for real then? - Sure.</font>

1887
00:44:51,090 --> 00:44:53,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The mind game begins before the game even starts.)</font>

1888
00:44:51,760 --> 00:44:53,160
<font size="64">- No holding back? - Of course.</font>

1889
00:44:54,760 --> 00:44:55,900
<font size="64">Will this even work?</font>

1890
00:44:56,870 --> 00:44:58,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pulling)</font>

1891
00:44:57,370 --> 00:44:58,500
<font size="64">Wait, he's pretty strong.</font>

1892
00:44:58,670 --> 00:44:59,970
<font size="64">- I didn't... - He's strong.</font>

1893
00:44:59,970 --> 00:45:01,670
<font size="64">- He's really strong. - I didn't even pull.</font>

1894
00:45:00,370 --> 00:45:03,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Relaxed)</font>

1895
00:45:01,670 --> 00:45:02,970
<font size="64">Seok Jin's really strong.</font>

1896
00:45:03,440 --> 00:45:04,970
<font size="64">- He's on the heavier side. - That's right.</font>

1897
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:06,480
<font size="64">Seok Jin...</font>

1898
00:45:06,740 --> 00:45:07,910
<font size="64">I see you're bad at catching.</font>

1899
00:45:08,480 --> 00:45:09,880
<font size="64">Was that too sudden for you?</font>

1900
00:45:08,610 --> 00:45:12,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Provoking)</font>

1901
00:45:09,880 --> 00:45:11,510
<font size="64">The game hasn't really started.</font>

1902
00:45:11,980 --> 00:45:13,450
<font size="64">- Yes, catch it like that. - Right.</font>

1903
00:45:12,410 --> 00:45:13,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Catch it like I did.)</font>

1904
00:45:13,720 --> 00:45:16,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The tension between them continues.)</font>

1905
00:45:17,790 --> 00:45:18,990
<font size="64">Seok Jin, wait.</font>

1906
00:45:19,860 --> 00:45:21,920
<font size="64">Seok Jin, what's the matter with you?</font>

1907
00:45:22,190 --> 00:45:23,760
<font size="64">Hold on. I'll go next.</font>

1908
00:45:23,760 --> 00:45:24,830
<font size="64">- Wait. - It's my turn, right?</font>

1909
00:45:25,330 --> 00:45:27,060
<font size="64">It's not that. You should've caught it.</font>

1910
00:45:25,630 --> 00:45:27,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Flustered)</font>

1911
00:45:27,060 --> 00:45:28,300
<font size="64">- It's a practice round. - We're taking turns.</font>

1912
00:45:28,400 --> 00:45:29,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Catch it!)</font>

1913
00:45:29,700 --> 00:45:30,700
<font size="64">Don't you know what dodgeball is?</font>

1914
00:45:30,870 --> 00:45:32,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Full force)</font>

1915
00:45:32,530 --> 00:45:34,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Deadpan)</font>

1916
00:45:33,340 --> 00:45:34,500
<font size="64">- Why are you going at it? - Won Hun.</font>

1917
00:45:34,540 --> 00:45:35,670
<font size="64">He started it.</font>

1918
00:45:35,370 --> 00:45:37,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fuming)</font>

1919
00:45:35,670 --> 00:45:37,340
<font size="64">- Seok Jin... - I was just warming up.</font>

1920
00:45:37,340 --> 00:45:38,470
<font size="64">- It's not that. - Don't get into it.</font>

1921
00:45:37,910 --> 00:45:39,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calm down.)</font>

1922
00:45:38,470 --> 00:45:39,940
<font size="64">- It's all right. - What's with them?</font>

1923
00:45:39,370 --> 00:45:41,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He takes the ball before things get heated.)</font>

1924
00:45:39,940 --> 00:45:41,210
<font size="64">Why are you getting into it with the kid?</font>

1925
00:45:41,210 --> 00:45:43,680
<font size="64">We're not fighting. Kid? He's a full-grown man.</font>

1926
00:45:44,110 --> 00:45:45,550
<font size="64">- I was just warming up. - Stop it.</font>

1927
00:45:45,550 --> 00:45:47,280
<font size="64">You're going after him like you really mean it.</font>

1928
00:45:45,580 --> 00:45:47,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bickering again)</font>

1929
00:45:47,750 --> 00:45:48,780
<font size="64">Haha, what do I do?</font>

1930
00:45:48,420 --> 00:45:50,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Snapping the band)</font>

1931
00:45:48,980 --> 00:45:50,650
<font size="64">- Won Hun, come on. - Won Hun.</font>

1932
00:45:50,720 --> 00:45:52,590
<font size="64">- This is part of a long joke. - Of course.</font>

1933
00:45:51,290 --> 00:45:54,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Don't misunderstand.)</font>

1934
00:45:52,990 --> 00:45:54,220
<font size="64">- Back and forth. - This is how we joke around.</font>

1935
00:45:54,220 --> 00:45:55,960
<font size="64">- Banter. - Banter.</font>

1936
00:45:56,330 --> 00:45:58,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Their banter is as addictive as the smell of a belly button.)</font>

1937
00:45:57,390 --> 00:45:59,230
<font size="64">- The ball will be in the middle. - Okay.</font>

1938
00:45:59,230 --> 00:46:00,600
<font size="64">- Get ready. - Let's do this.</font>

1939
00:46:00,500 --> 00:46:03,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The team that gets the ball 1st goes 1st.)</font>

1940
00:46:00,600 --> 00:46:01,600
<font size="64">- Let's go! - Yes!</font>

1941
00:46:01,600 --> 00:46:03,170
<font size="64">- Get ready... - The center.</font>

1942
00:46:03,170 --> 00:46:04,970
<font size="64">- Go, team. - You've got this.</font>

1943
00:46:03,930 --> 00:46:06,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Serious)</font>

1944
00:46:04,970 --> 00:46:06,640
<font size="64">Run for it straight away.</font>

1945
00:46:06,370 --> 00:46:08,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Round 1 begins!)</font>

1946
00:46:07,840 --> 00:46:09,140
<font size="64">- Get it. - That's it.</font>

1947
00:46:10,070 --> 00:46:11,140
<font size="64">- That's it. - Hold on.</font>

1948
00:46:11,140 --> 00:46:12,170
<font size="64">- Okay. - I got it.</font>

1949
00:46:11,210 --> 00:46:13,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Jin kicks the ball and takes it.)</font>

1950
00:46:12,170 --> 00:46:13,240
<font size="64">- What's wrong? - Wait.</font>

1951
00:46:13,140 --> 00:46:15,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Orange is on the offense first.)</font>

1952
00:46:13,240 --> 00:46:14,410
<font size="64">- Go. - Can you kick it?</font>

1953
00:46:14,410 --> 00:46:16,010
<font size="64">Yes, that's allowed.</font>

1954
00:46:19,550 --> 00:46:21,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He receives the ball and strikes.)</font>

1955
00:46:19,750 --> 00:46:20,920
<font size="64">- Okay. - Yes!</font>

1956
00:46:21,620 --> 00:46:22,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Losing 1 point)</font>

1957
00:46:21,620 --> 00:46:22,650
<font size="64">- Okay. - Yes!</font>

1958
00:46:22,920 --> 00:46:25,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Orange: 0, Team Pink: Minus 1)</font>

1959
00:46:22,920 --> 00:46:24,220
<font size="64">Haha, minus one point.</font>

1960
00:46:24,790 --> 00:46:26,560
<font size="64">They can't attack anyway.</font>

1961
00:46:26,820 --> 00:46:28,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Players outside the court can only pass, not attack.)</font>

1962
00:46:27,390 --> 00:46:28,760
<font size="64">Pass it to me. That's it.</font>

1963
00:46:28,760 --> 00:46:29,760
<font size="64">Wait, you're on our team.</font>

1964
00:46:29,760 --> 00:46:31,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Orange is on the offense again.)</font>

1965
00:46:32,490 --> 00:46:34,700
<font size="64">Keep passing it around. That's it.</font>

1966
00:46:33,700 --> 00:46:35,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Holding tightly)</font>

1967
00:46:36,200 --> 00:46:38,130
<font size="64">Keep passing it around. That's it.</font>

1968
00:46:36,370 --> 00:46:39,370
