<font size="64">Okay. The last shot.</font>

2358
00:55:24,960 --> 00:55:26,230
<font size="64">- Catch it. - We're a point ahead!</font>

2359
00:55:26,230 --> 00:55:27,300
<font size="64">Throw it anywhere.</font>

2360
00:55:26,530 --> 00:55:28,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Pink has a chance to attack.)</font>

2361
00:55:27,300 --> 00:55:28,960
<font size="64">- Be quick. - Defense!</font>

2362
00:55:29,300 --> 00:55:30,970
<font size="64">- Come on! - Herd them.</font>

2363
00:55:30,970 --> 00:55:33,570
<font size="64">- Herd them. Yes, good. - Throw it anywhere.</font>

2364
00:55:31,970 --> 00:55:34,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If they keep holding out, Team Orange will win!)</font>

2365
00:55:34,040 --> 00:55:36,300
<font size="64">- Now! - Catch it, and it's ours!</font>

2366
00:55:36,400 --> 00:55:38,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Won Hun attacks!)</font>

2367
00:55:37,410 --> 00:55:38,440
<font size="64">Catch it!</font>

2368
00:55:38,440 --> 00:55:40,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What will happen?)</font>

2369
00:55:40,140 --> 00:55:41,140
<font size="64">Now!</font>

2370
00:55:41,310 --> 00:55:43,140
<font size="64">He caught it! Nice one!</font>

2371
00:55:43,140 --> 00:55:44,550
<font size="64">He caught it! Nice one!</font>

2372
00:55:44,550 --> 00:55:46,350
<font size="64">- Well done! - Nice one, Seok Sam!</font>

2373
00:55:45,810 --> 00:55:48,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam halted the attack!)</font>

2374
00:55:46,350 --> 00:55:48,150
<font size="64">Nice one, Seok Sam!</font>

2375
00:55:48,150 --> 00:55:49,680
<font size="64">He's so good at catching!</font>

2376
00:55:48,480 --> 00:55:50,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Acknowledging)</font>

2377
00:55:49,920 --> 00:55:51,950
<font size="64">- Aim for the feet. - Go for the legs.</font>

2378
00:55:52,190 --> 00:55:53,860
<font size="64">- It's over. - Nicely done!</font>

2379
00:55:53,860 --> 00:55:55,060
<font size="64">- That was rough. - We won.</font>

2380
00:55:54,060 --> 00:55:55,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam's last-second save...)</font>

2381
00:55:55,060 --> 00:55:56,790
<font size="64">- We came from behind. - At the end...</font>

2382
00:55:55,890 --> 00:55:58,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(helped Team Orange come from behind and win.)</font>

2383
00:55:56,790 --> 00:55:58,790
<font size="64">- Good job catching the ball... - I managed somehow.</font>

2384
00:55:58,790 --> 00:56:00,160
<font size="64">- Well done. - Nice one.</font>

2385
00:56:00,160 --> 00:56:01,600
<font size="64">You're nothing, Won Hun.</font>

2386
00:56:00,860 --> 00:56:02,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Down and out)</font>

2387
00:56:02,960 --> 00:56:06,430
<font size="64">The final score is -12 to -13.</font>

2388
00:56:06,430 --> 00:56:07,670
<font size="64">Team Orange won.</font>

2389
00:56:07,670 --> 00:56:09,700
<font size="64">- Yes! - Okay.</font>

2390
00:56:09,840 --> 00:56:11,440
<font size="64">- Nice. - Okay!</font>

2391
00:56:11,440 --> 00:56:12,710
<font size="64">Seok Jin caught them all.</font>

2392
00:56:12,510 --> 00:56:16,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Veteran Seok Sam did a great job.)</font>

2393
00:56:12,810 --> 00:56:14,640
<font size="64">- You did great. - I'm so hot.</font>

2394
00:56:14,640 --> 00:56:16,480
<font size="64">- Well done. - Nice teamwork.</font>

2395
00:56:16,610 --> 00:56:19,210
<font size="64">Team Jae Seok won the game.</font>

2396
00:56:18,310 --> 00:56:20,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He can't take it off by himself.)</font>

2397
00:56:19,880 --> 00:56:22,150
<font size="64">The winning team gets a prize and a lovely meal.</font>

2398
00:56:21,680 --> 00:56:24,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Orange has a chance to win food and prizes.)</font>

2399
00:56:22,150 --> 00:56:23,350
<font size="64">Okay!</font>

2400
00:56:23,350 --> 00:56:25,490
<font size="64">We'll show you the prizes first.</font>

2401
00:56:24,650 --> 00:56:26,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What's the prize this time?)</font>

2402
00:56:25,790 --> 00:56:27,820
<font size="64">- This is it. - The prizes are upgraded.</font>

2403
00:56:27,820 --> 00:56:29,760
<font size="64">- What are they? - Premium honey.</font>

2404
00:56:29,760 --> 00:56:32,460
<font size="64">- Honey. - Premium cinema tickets for two.</font>

2405
00:56:32,460 --> 00:56:33,860
<font size="64">Freshly harvested corn.</font>

2406
00:56:33,930 --> 00:56:37,300
<font size="64">The ball Won Hun threw earlier smashed the honey jar.</font>

2407
00:56:37,430 --> 00:56:39,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A honey jar Won Hun broke?)</font>

2408
00:56:37,730 --> 00:56:38,900
<font size="64">It's smashed?</font>

2409
00:56:39,730 --> 00:56:41,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Before the game began)</font>

2410
00:56:41,640 --> 00:56:42,770
<font size="64">Nice.</font>

2411
00:56:41,670 --> 00:56:43,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Jin and Won Hun played catch.)</font>

2412
00:56:44,940 --> 00:56:46,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Smash!)</font>

2413
00:56:45,870 --> 00:56:47,010
<font size="64">Won Hun...</font>

2414
00:56:47,240 --> 00:56:50,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Won Hun threw a home run.)</font>

2415
00:56:47,280 --> 00:56:49,880
<font size="64">- Sorry. I was warming up. - Don't go overboard, Won Hun.</font>

2416
00:56:49,880 --> 00:56:51,680
<font size="64">Sorry. Was there something here?</font>

2417
00:56:51,150 --> 00:56:54,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The honey jar cracked.)</font>

2418
00:56:51,750 --> 00:56:54,080
<font size="64">- What was it? - It's fine. Don't worry.</font>

2419
00:56:54,080 --> 00:56:55,720
<font size="64">We taped it back up.</font>

2420
00:56:54,620 --> 00:56:56,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The broken jar has been temporarily put back together.)</font>

2421
00:56:56,050 --> 00:56:57,950
<font size="64">- Because of me? - Will it be tape-flavored honey?</font>

2422
00:56:58,990 --> 00:57:01,160
<font size="64">- Won Hun. - Did you save some of the honey?</font>

2423
00:56:59,590 --> 00:57:02,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling sorry)</font>

2424
00:57:01,160 --> 00:57:03,090
<font size="64">- The contents are safe. - The honey's fine.</font>

2425
00:57:02,090 --> 00:57:04,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fortunately, everything inside the jar is fine.)</font>

2426
00:57:03,090 --> 00:57:04,860
<font size="64">- It's just the jar. - It's smashed.</font>

2427
00:57:04,860 --> 00:57:05,960
<font size="64">Movie tickets.</font>

2428
00:57:05,060 --> 00:57:07,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Premium honey)</font>

2429
00:57:05,960 --> 00:57:09,400
<font size="64">Strain the honey with a cloth before you eat any.</font>

2430
00:57:09,400 --> 00:57:12,470
<font size="64">A cotton cloth. Strain it with that.</font>

2431
00:57:12,530 --> 00:57:15,240
<font size="64">You people didn't think this through.</font>

2432
00:57:15,240 --> 00:57:17,710
<font size="64">Don't put anything there if you know we're playing dodge ball.</font>

2433
00:57:15,970 --> 00:57:18,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Serious)</font>

2434
00:57:17,740 --> 00:57:18,940
<font size="64">You should've kept it...</font>

2435
00:57:18,340 --> 00:57:19,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calm down.)</font>

2436
00:57:18,940 --> 00:57:21,010
<font size="64">- Well... - You chose wisely.</font>

2437
00:57:21,740 --> 00:57:24,910
<font size="64">To decide who takes the prizes, you'll set off one by one...</font>

2438
00:57:24,910 --> 00:57:26,050
<font size="64">- to vote. - Not again.</font>

2439
00:57:26,050 --> 00:57:27,220
<font size="64">Is it red or blue again?</font>

2440
00:57:26,510 --> 00:57:29,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only a few members can win a prize.)</font>

2441
00:57:27,220 --> 00:57:28,620
<font size="64">- Yes. - It's red or blue again.</font>

2442
00:57:28,620 --> 00:57:31,920
<font size="64">There are four of you, so there might be an even split.</font>

2443
00:57:30,080 --> 00:57:32,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If everyone picks the same color or it's 2-to-2 split,)</font>

2444
00:57:31,920 --> 00:57:33,760
<font size="64">Then the prizes will get carried over.</font>

2445
00:57:32,820 --> 00:57:35,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(the prize will carry over to the next round.)</font>

2446
00:57:33,760 --> 00:57:35,390
<font size="64">- They're carried over? - Jae Seok.</font>

2447
00:57:35,720 --> 00:57:36,860
<font size="64">Let's give it to someone.</font>

2448
00:57:37,330 --> 00:57:40,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only 1 person can win the prize anyway.)</font>

2449
00:57:37,530 --> 00:57:38,660
<font size="64">- Okay. - Give it to someone.</font>

2450
00:57:38,660 --> 00:57:39,930
<font size="64">We need it to be 3 to 1.</font>

2451
00:57:39,930 --> 00:57:41,800
<font size="64">- Let someone have it. - Me, you mean?</font>

2452
00:57:40,800 --> 00:57:43,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Confident)</font>

2453
00:57:41,830 --> 00:57:43,030
<font size="64">- Yes, you. - Great.</font>

2454
00:57:43,030 --> 00:57:45,170
<font size="64">- I'll go red. - Blue.</font>

2455
00:57:45,300 --> 00:57:47,100
<font size="64">- Okay. I'll go red. - I'll go red.</font>

2456
00:57:46,600 --> 00:57:49,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They decide to help Eun Bi.)</font>

2457
00:57:47,770 --> 00:57:49,800
<font size="64">- I'll pick blue. - Wait.</font>

2458
00:57:49,000 --> 00:57:50,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Wait.)</font>

2459
00:57:49,940 --> 00:57:52,970
<font size="64">Isn't this the office worker team from a long-ago episode?</font>

2460
00:57:52,970 --> 00:57:54,540
<font size="64">- She betrayed us. - It was us three.</font>

2461
00:57:54,540 --> 00:57:56,040
<font size="64">- It's the same three. - Yes.</font>

2462
00:57:54,840 --> 00:57:59,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Coincidentally, all three of them have suffered at her hands.)</font>

2463
00:57:56,040 --> 00:57:57,150
<font size="64">Eun Bi duped us.</font>

2464
00:57:57,150 --> 00:57:59,950
<font size="64">- Eun Bi stabbed us in the back. - We're the three she duped.</font>

2465
00:57:59,950 --> 00:58:01,320
<font size="64">- In Sangam-dong. - I'll go blue.</font>

2466
00:58:00,380 --> 00:58:02,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She doesn't care.)</font>

2467
00:58:01,320 --> 00:58:03,080
<font size="64">- Blue, okay. - Blue.</font>

2468
00:58:02,580 --> 00:58:05,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will their promise be kept?)</font>

2469
00:58:06,250 --> 00:58:08,920
<font size="64">I brought all my sincerity with me.</font>

2470
00:58:10,160 --> 00:58:11,790
<font size="64">I'll play honestly.</font>

2471
00:58:12,630 --> 00:58:14,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eun Bi chose blue as promised.)</font>

2472
00:58:15,360 --> 00:58:16,500
<font size="64">Switching...</font>

2473
00:58:17,800 --> 00:58:19,700
<font size="64">will only ruin it, so I'll stick to red.</font>

2474
00:58:21,200 --> 00:58:23,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Jin also chose red as promised.)</font>

2475
00:58:21,940 --> 00:58:23,670
<font size="64">I chose red and lost earlier.</font>

2476
00:58:24,940 --> 00:58:28,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did Jae Seok and Se Chan keep their word?)</font>

2477
00:58:27,940 --> 00:58:30,080
<font size="64">- I'll announce the result. - Okay!</font>

2478
00:58:30,350 --> 00:58:32,980
<font size="64">- You each chose red or blue. - Yes.</font>

2479
00:58:32,980 --> 00:58:34,450
<font size="64">Let it not be an even split.</font>

2480
00:58:34,450 --> 00:58:35,780
<font size="64">We got a 3-to-1 result.</font>

2481
00:58:36,620 --> 00:58:38,650
<font size="64">- Three to one? - Yes.</font>

2482
00:58:37,520 --> 00:58:40,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did they all help Eun Bi as promised?)</font>

2483
00:58:38,650 --> 00:58:40,390
<font size="64">- Someone wins? - No way.</font>

2484
00:58:40,390 --> 00:58:42,460
<font size="64">- The one to take the prizes. - There's a winner.</font>

2485
00:58:42,460 --> 00:58:43,730
<font size="64">- That one person... - Who is it?</font>

2486
00:58:43,730 --> 00:58:44,730
<font size="64">- Who is it? - What happened?</font>

2487
00:58:44,730 --> 00:58:46,530
<font size="64">is Jee Seok Jin who chose red.</font>

2488
00:58:46,530 --> 00:58:47,560
<font size="64">What?</font>

2489
00:58:47,560 --> 00:58:49,760
<font size="64">- Jee Seok Jin who chose red. - What?</font>

2490
00:58:49,000 --> 00:58:52,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's Seok Jin, not Eun Bi?)</font>

2491
00:58:52,270 --> 00:58:55,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What happened?)</font>

2492
00:58:52,600 --> 00:58:54,740
<font size="64">- This is called know-how! - I thought too hard.</font>

2493
00:58:55,000 --> 00:58:57,240
<font size="64">- I'll go next. You'll go? - Yes.</font>

2494
00:58:56,140 --> 00:58:58,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan went after Eun Bi.)</font>

2495
00:58:58,040 --> 00:59:01,780
<font size="64">I'll go red the whole day. No, wait.</font>

2496
00:59:02,980 --> 00:59:04,310
<font size="64">There's a fingerprint.</font>

2497
00:59:03,280 --> 00:59:06,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He notices a fingerprint on the button.)</font>

2498
00:59:09,180 --> 00:59:12,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He thinks Eun Bi chose red and switches to blue.)</font>

2499
00:59:12,790 --> 00:59:14,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pondering)</font>

2500
00:59:16,560 --> 00:59:18,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok also chooses blue to pay for the past betrayal.)</font>

2501
00:59:19,490 --> 00:59:21,230
<font size="64">- This is so shocking. - It's not about that.</font>

2502
00:59:21,230 --> 00:59:22,660
<font size="64">- Gosh, Seok Sam... - Hey.</font>

2503
00:59:21,560 --> 00:59:24,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The butterfly effect of her actions)</font>

2504
00:59:22,660 --> 00:59:24,230
<font size="64">Seok Sam, I'm disappointed.</font>

2505
00:59:24,230 --> 00:59:25,900
<font size="64">- Yes! - Seok Sam.</font>

2506
00:59:24,800 --> 00:59:27,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Jin got the prize thanks to that.)</font>

2507
00:59:25,900 --> 00:59:28,040
<font size="64">- You. - Do you want to swap something?</font>

2508
00:59:28,040 --> 00:59:30,710
<font size="64">You take the honey. You smashed the jar.</font>

2509
00:59:30,710 --> 00:59:32,410
<font size="64">- Do you have anything nice? - Jo Malone.</font>

2510
00:59:32,610 --> 00:59:35,540
<font size="64">I love Jo Malone too. Forget the hand wash.</font>

2511
00:59:33,010 --> 00:59:34,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I can't give you that.)</font>

2512
00:59:34,540 --> 00:59:36,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Luxury body wash, peaches, toilet paper)</font>

2513
00:59:35,540 --> 00:59:36,540
<font size="64">The peaches.</font>

2514
00:59:36,640 --> 00:59:37,780
<font size="64">- Okay. - Peaches are nice.</font>

2515
00:59:37,610 --> 00:59:39,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They decide to exchange.)</font>

2516
00:59:37,780 --> 00:59:39,410
<font size="64">Sure. I like peaches.</font>

2517
00:59:39,750 --> 00:59:42,220
<font size="64">Could you give me a few peaches?</font>

2518
00:59:42,850 --> 00:59:45,190
<font size="64">- What? - Can I have a few peaches?</font>

2519
00:59:43,920 --> 00:59:45,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mumbling)</font>

2520
00:59:45,190 --> 00:59:46,590
<font size="64">Be quiet, you punk.</font>

2521
00:59:46,590 --> 00:59:48,490
<font size="64">- Today, you're a bit too... - Seok Jin...</font>

2522
00:59:48,660 --> 00:59:51,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(ScrooGee is particularly cold toward Eun Bi.)</font>

2523
00:59:48,760 --> 00:59:50,160
<font size="64">- Gosh. - Come on.</font>

2524
00:59:50,160 --> 00:59:51,430
<font size="64">Eun Bi's charm isn't working.</font>

2525
00:59:51,660 --> 00:59:53,860
<font size="64">- However much... - Eun Bi.</font>

2526
00:59:53,860 --> 00:59:55,530
<font size="64">- Don't be upset. - However much science advances...</font>

2527
00:59:55,530 --> 00:59:56,600
<font size="64">Don't be upset. It happens.</font>

2528
00:59:56,600 --> 00:59:59,230
<font size="64">When it comes to Eun Bi, Seok Sam...</font>

2529
00:59:59,230 --> 01:00:01,300
<font size="64">- Is he strict? - He still has a grudge.</font>

2530
01:00:00,200 --> 01:00:03,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Holding a grudge)</font>

2531
01:00:01,540 --> 01:00:04,240
<font size="64">You chose your prizes, so we'll head over to eat.</font>

2532
01:00:04,240 --> 01:00:06,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lunch awaits the winning team.)</font>

2533
01:00:04,240 --> 01:00:05,910
<font size="64">- Okay! - Yes!</font>

2534
01:00:07,080 --> 01:00:08,340
<font size="64">Okay. What's this?</font>

2535
01:00:07,380 --> 01:00:08,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A feast, a humble meal)</font>

2536
01:00:08,340 --> 01:00:09,480
<font size="64">My gosh.</font>

2537
01:00:08,440 --> 01:00:10,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dramatically different spreads)</font>

2538
01:00:09,980 --> 01:00:11,080
<font size="64">It looks delicious.</font>

2539
01:00:11,080 --> 01:00:12,710
<font size="64">- My gosh. - It looks so good.</font>

2540
01:00:11,480 --> 01:00:13,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Envious)</font>

2541
01:00:12,710 --> 01:00:13,750
<font size="64">What's that?</font>

2542
01:00:14,150 --> 01:00:16,220
<font size="64">We shouldn't have had hamburgers.</font>

2543
01:00:16,550 --> 01:00:18,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Excited)</font>

2544
01:00:16,550 --> 01:00:17,790
<font size="64">This is a must.</font>

2545
01:00:17,790 --> 01:00:19,590
<font size="64">- It looks good. - My gosh.</font>

2546
01:00:18,290 --> 01:00:19,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

2547
01:00:20,790 --> 01:00:21,960
<font size="64">- Gosh. - It's too much...</font>

2548
01:00:20,990 --> 01:00:24,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only the winning team can enjoy this.)</font>

2549
01:00:21,960 --> 01:00:23,060
<font size="64">- for us. - It looks great.</font>

2550
01:00:23,060 --> 01:00:25,630
<font size="64">For lunch today, you get spicy pollack soup.</font>

2551
